{"id":"P090-2","subject":"P","unit":"P090","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 1~50문항","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P090-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n파라미터가 변할 때, 특성방정식의 근이 복소 평면 위에서\n\n이동할 때의 시스템을 통해 안정도를 분석하는 방법은?\n\n\n① 근궤적법       ② 루스-허위츠 판별법\n\n③ 나이퀴스트 판별법   ④ 보드선도법\n\n⑤ 상태공간법","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":476}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n상태 행렬이        때, 고윳값은?                  일\n\n\n① ,        ② , \n\n③ ,         ④ , \n\n⑤ , ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":593},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":906}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n궤간이 1435mm인 곡선궤도를 통과하는 전기철도의\n\n속도가 60kmh일 때, 적당한 캔트(cant)는 13mm이\n\n다. 이 곡선궤도의 반경은 약 몇 m인가?\n\n\n① 3129         ② 2740\n\n③ 2332         ④ 2148\n\n⑤ 1622","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":976}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n면적이 50m인 방에서 작업면의 평균조도가 30lx일 때,\n\n방에 설치된 전등(광원)의 총 광속lm은?\n\n(단, 전등 효율은 85이다.)\n\n\n① 1275         ② 1345\n\n③ 1500         ④ 1625\n\n⑤ 1765","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1016}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n비열이 3kcalkg⦁°C인 매질 10kg의 온도를 20°C\n\n에서 140°C로 올리기 위해 전열장치를 3분간 사용하였\n\n을 때, 전열장치에 필요한 전력W은?\n\n(단, 주어지지 않은 조건은 무시한다.)\n\n\n① 41.86        ② 62.79\n\n③ 75.35        ④ 83.72\n\n⑤ 94.19","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":593},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m30-e1.webp","width":696,"height":866}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n고압 가공전선과 통신용 안테나의 이격거리는 몇 m이상\n\n인가? (단, 케이블이 아닌 경우이다.)\n\n\n① 0.5          ② 0.6\n\n③ 0.7          ④ 0.8\n\n⑤ 0.9","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e12-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1216}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P090-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n전로를 대지로부터 반드시 절연하여야 하는 것은?\n\n\n① 전기보일러      ② 활주로\n\n③ 전기로        ④ 전기욕기\n\n⑤ 전해로","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.13 한국토지주택공사 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e12-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-b